{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-laguna-tower","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"laguna-tower-ifa-hotels-jlt-jumeirah-lake-towers","about":"Laguna Tower is a multifunctional complex that includes a five-star Movenpick Hotels hotel and blocks of residential residences. The project was realized by the developer IFA Hotels &amp; Resorts. The high-rise building has 40 floors and two-level underground parking.The building has 296 residential units: studios, apartments with 1-3 bedrooms and penthouses of various layouts. The building offers views of the Jumeirah Lakes Towers and Western Lakes Almas neighborhood.Residents have access to all the benefits of the infrastructure of the complex: 24/7 security with video surveillance, concierge service 24/7, underground parking, conference room for events, cleaning services, fitness center, spa, sauna, restaurant, children's area, swimming pool.The project is located in the Jumeirah Lakes Towers neighborhood near Dubai's main street, Sheikh Zayed. DMCC metro station is only 8-10 minutes walk from the apartments. Dubai International Airport and Al Maktoum International Airport are about 25-35 minutes away by car.Various stores, cafes, restaurants and beauty salons are within walking distance. Baby Home JLT, Kids Kingdom Nurseries JLT, Three Little Fingers Learning Center and Derma One Medical Center, Dr. K. DMCC Medical Center are within 3-5 minutes walking distance.","price":1500000,"title":"Laguna Tower","bitrix":{"id":723,"pf_id":"are.3.14078","source":null,"project_id":"JLT Cluster A","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Laguna Tower","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"IFA Hotels & Resorts","project_location":"Jumeirah Lake Towers"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1077/images/2024/02/21/340x252/ACLke6krcyLHQ1cKKtm2k3DAfyaJro1NsappeDZM.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.n